{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0988"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/tv, film-media/tv","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__tv.g4.json quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/zz-r2-film-media__tv.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",60],["-","Friday"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","night,"],["+","weekday"],["=",1],["+","evenings, "],["=",52],["+","the presenter "],["=",10],["-","in"],["+","and"],["=",1],["+","hosted himself from its first edition on 14 February "],["=",2],["-","and"],["+","until"],["=",1],["+","1987, before "],["=",6],["+","it "],["=",12],["-","Europe."],["+","Europe;"],["=",1],["+","Wolfgang Lippert filled in for a short spell in 1992–1993. "],["=",568],["+","Private television also brought the weekday ritual. Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten, the RTL soap opera set in Berlin and known simply as GZSZ, began on 11 May 1992 as an adaptation of the Australian serial \"The Restless Years\" and became Germany's first true daily soap. Broadcast every weekday evening ever since, it has passed 8,000 episodes – more than any other German soap opera – and served as a launch pad for actors and pop singers alike.\n\n"],["=",242],["+","Lippert, "],["=",6],["+","Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten | RTL | since 1992 | ensemble cast |\n| "],["=",23]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",58],["-","den"],["+","die"],["=",1],["-","Freitagabend,"],["+","Werktagabende,"],["=",49],["+","der Moderator "],["=",4],["-","1981 "],["=",10],["-","die"],["+","von"],["=",1],["+","der ersten Ausgabe am 14. Februar 1981 bis 1987 selbst präsentierte, bevor "],["=",4],["+","sie "],["=",8],["-","machte."],["+","machte;"],["=",1],["+","Wolfgang Lippert sprang 1992–1993 für kurze Zeit ein. "],["=",550],["+","Das Privatfernsehen brachte auch das Ritual für die Werktage. Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten, die in Berlin spielende RTL-Seifenoper, die alle nur GZSZ nennen, startete am 11. Mai 1992 als Adaption der australischen Serie „The Restless Years“ und wurde Deutschlands erste echte Daily Soap. Seither an jedem Werktagabend ausgestrahlt, hat sie mehr als 8.000 Folgen hinter sich – mehr als jede andere deutsche Seifenoper – und war Sprungbrett für Schauspieler und Popsängerinnen gleichermaßen.\n\n"],["=",238],["+","Lippert, "],["=",6],["+","Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten | RTL | seit 1992 | Ensemble |\n| "],["=",23]]}]},
